# [IPSECME](../wg/ipsecme.html)

## Summary
The IP Security Maintenance and Extensions (IPSECME) Working Group met at IETF 127. The session covered working group administration and document status updates, implementation and interoperability reports, proposals for post-quantum cryptographic extensions (large KEM embedding, fragmentation optimizations, Merkle Tree Certificates, and KEM-based authentication), updates to symmetric algorithms (AES-GCM-SIV for IPsec), protocol deprecations (AH and IPCOMP), and operational challenges in Non-Terrestrial Networks (NTN).

