## Decisions and Action Items

### Decisions
1. **`draft-ietf-ipsecme-ikev2-sa-ts-payloads-opt`**: Clarifying text will be added specifying that returning an `INVALID_SYNTAX` notify payload is the required behavior when receiving both an optimized rekey notify and an SA payload.
2. **BEET Mode Consolidation**: Naming/replacement requests were approved to consolidate DataTracker entries into two drafts (`draft-ietf-ipsecme-ikev2-beet-mode` and `draft-ietf-ipsecme-rfc7402-beet-update`) prior to moving both forward to Working Group Last Call.
3. **Deprecation Strategy**: IPCOMP will be deprecated. AH will not be obsoleted; a Best Current Practice (BCP) document will be authored to restrict AH usage to specific IPv6 option/label protection scenarios.

